  OUT --> PS[Pub/Sub / Cloud Tasks]
  PS --> WK[Workers]
  WK --> PG
  API --> GCS[Cloud Storage]
  WK --> GCS
  RT --> VK
  RT --> PG
  SRC[External Event Sources] --> ING[Ingestion Workers]
  ING --> PS
  API --> ID[External strong identity provider]
  API --> PH[PostHog\nanalytics + experiments]
  API --> BQ[BigQuery]
  API --> OBS[OTel / Sentry]
  OPS[Operational Flags + Client Policies] --> PG
  EAS[Expo EAS Build / Submit / Update] -. delivers .-> M
  M -. REST recovery .-> API

